OL,3,GNEWSAHomes to rise from ashes of former
OL,4,Aarson-hit pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "eyesore" site where a former pub
OL,7,Ftargeted in an arson attack had fallen
OL,8,Finto disrepair is to be transformed
OL,9,Finto new homes nearly a decade after it
OL,10,Fclosed.
OL,12,FWork has started to build 87 social
OL,13,Frent homes for over-55s on the former
OL,14,FGriffin pub in Yarmouth Road, Thorpe St
OL,15,FAndrew, on the outskirts of Norwich.
OL,17,FIt was derelict for several years with
OL,18,Fefforts to demolish it refused. But
OL,19,Fthat changed after fire destroyed much
OL,20,Fof it in 2021 with plans to knock it
OL,21,Fdown approved just days later.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
